#  - "The binding spec", "the design note", "the task brief" and "this
#    patch's report" cited above are session documents that are not in the
#    repository; the design's durable form is DESIGN §7.0.2x and this
#    header. Point numbering in 0011's header is the implementer's and has
#    gaps.
